@startuml
!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/component-diagram-style.iuml

title Layering with Sidecar Pattern\nCross-cutting utilities live outside the layer hierarchy

rectangle "**Presentation**" as L4 $fill_primary
rectangle "**Application**" as L3 $fill_ok
rectangle "**Domain**" as L2 $fill_caution
rectangle "**Foundation**" as L1 $fill_alt

rectangle "<<sidecar>>\n**Cross-Cutting Utilities**\nLogging | Configuration | Monitoring" as SIDE $fill_invalid

L4 -[$line_primary]-> L3
L3 -[$line_primary]-> L2
L2 -[$line_primary]-> L1

L4 .[$deep_caution].> SIDE
L3 .[$deep_caution].> SIDE
L2 .[$deep_caution].> SIDE
L1 .[$deep_caution].> SIDE

note right of SIDE
  Sidecar modules are
  accessible from **all layers**.
  Use sparingly for genuinely
  cross-cutting concerns only.
end note
@enduml
